  "description": "Shenora's iOS shell: the MAUI HybridWebView IPC transport (the same envelope the desktop shell speaks, over SendRawMessage/RawMessageReceived), a UI-thread dispatcher, and the iOS implementations of the Shenora.Core shell contracts. The platform owns the loop, so the app drives ShenoraApplication.Start/Stop from its own lifecycle rather than calling Run. Shares its source with Shenora.Android.",
